# Build artifacts
build/
*.o
*.obj
*.exe
*.bin
*.bank0*
*.BANK0*
*.adf
*.ADF
*.sfc
*.gba
# Mega Drive ROM dumps use the .md extension. Avoid blanket-ignoring
# *.md or we'll accidentally exclude README.md, PLAN.md, etc. Instead
# only ignore .md files inside build/.
build/*.md

# Reference originals (live in another-world-archive/)
reference/

# Editor + Python leftovers
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.swp
.DS_Store
